  "definition": "Profanity is present when the message contains at least one swear word or vulgar term: a curse or expletive (for example damn, hell or crap used as an expletive, shit, fuck, bloody as an intensifier), or vulgar slang for sex, genitals or excretion (for example dick, cock or pussy in the vulgar sense, asshole, piss). It counts wherever it appears: quoted, reported, friendly, joking or aimed at nobody. It does not count when the letters sit inside an ordinary longer word (Scunthorpe, cocktail, assess, Dickens), when the word is used in its ordinary literal or religious sense (a rooster, a cat, hell as a place in a religious statement), for identity slurs without a vulgar word, or for insults, threats or sexual content written without any vulgar word.",
